{"title":"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Simplicity)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Simplicity)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/f/58f83d4d7d692d9e5ae0dbd561e9e28ef0808623.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\left((2+1)^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1?\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4eb660f24d47d08f2d86199e65beddfa51ce318e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac58 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\frac{11}7 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\frac85 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{18}{11} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{15}8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"399\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all nonzero numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8acfd7d5ee559262593701b8dbd02e43ad96e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" /> recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b08696ff3d21d4653b9853f6293adb34eb8343c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{-1}=\\frac1a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"38\" /> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Reciprocal\" title=\"Reciprocal\">reciprocal</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45ef9cdc7c7d46920eac603663914e0d9261a99b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>The original expression becomes\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6e390a87fa7506ab50effbaadc0686e9ce4075f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left(\\left((2+1)^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1 &amp;= \\left(\\left(3^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\left(\\frac13+1\\right)^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\left(\\frac43\\right)^{-1}+1\\right)^{-1}+1 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\frac34+1\\right)^{-1}+1 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\frac74\\right)^{-1}+1 \\\\ &amp;= \\frac47+1 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{11}7}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"456\" height=\"365\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Simplicity.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Simplicity)\">Video Solution (Simplicity)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Simplicity)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g0o4BbECwlk&amp;t=16s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g0o4BbECwlk&amp;t=16s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/19mpsCcQzY0\">https://youtu.be/19mpsCcQzY0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vO-ELYmgRI8\">https://youtu.be/vO-ELYmgRI8</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cat3yTIpX4k\">https://youtu.be/cat3yTIpX4k</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A\">2018 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=